  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant for external appraisal of climate adaptation in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The consultancy would perform the external appraisal of the climate adaptation project in Rwanda.

The overall objective of the appraisal is a final quality assurance check in accordance to the Danida Aid Management Guidelines of projects between 10-39 mio. DKK, including review of the underlying documentation, the design and justification of the proposed new grant.</narrative>
